  "job_B9.2.2_20261117_215136": {
    "chunk_text": ", & eastnor\u00fe sindon \u00feyringas. & be nor\u00fean him sindon Ealdseaxan, & be nor\u00feanwestan him sindon Frisan, be westan & \u00feonan westnor\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t lond \u00fee mon Ongle h\u00e6t & Sillende & sumne d\u00e6l Dene. & be nor\u00fean him is Afdrede & eastnor\u00fe Wilte \u00fee mon H\u00e6feldan h\u00e6tt. & be eastan him is Wineda lond \u00fee mon h\u00e6tt Sysyle, & eastsu\u00fe, ofer sumd\u00e6l, Maroara. & hie Maroara habba\u00f0 be westan him \u00feyringas & Behemas & Begware healfe, & be su\u00fean him on To \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan beorgan licga\u00f0 Begwara landgem\u00e6ro & Sw\u00e6fa. \u00deonne be eastan Carendran londe, begeondan \u00fe\u00e6m westenne, is Pulgara land. & be eastan \u00fe\u00e6m is Creca land. & be eastan Maroara londe is Wisle lond. & be eastan \u00fe\u00e6m sint Datia, \u00fea \u00fee iu w\u00e6ron Gotan. Be nor\u00feaneastan Maroara sindon Dalamentsan, & be eastan Dalamentsan sindon Horigti. & be nor\u00fean Dalamentsan sindon Surpe, & be westan him Sysyle. Be nor\u00fean Horoti is M\u00e6g\u00fea land, & be nor\u00fean M\u00e6g\u00fea londe Sermende o\u00fe \u00fea beorgas Riffen. Be westan Su\u00fedenum is \u00fe\u00e6s garsecges earm \u00fee li\u00fe ymbutan \u00fe\u00e6t land Brettania, & be nor\u00fean him Nor\u00f0dene habba\u00f0 be nor\u00fean him \u00feone ilcan s\u00e6s earm \u00fee mon h\u00e6t Osts\u00e6, & be eastan him sindon Osti habba\u00f0 be nor\u00fean him \u00feone ilcan s\u00e6s earm & Winedas & Burgendan, & be su\u00fean him sindon Burgendan",
